:["Uses near black 2.6x more than the other paintings from the same museum(s), so camera and varnish are held equal (from 16 paintings here).","Uses smoky black 2.4x more than the other paintings from the same museum(s), so camera and varnish are held equal (from 16 paintings here).","Uses dark walnut 2.2x more than the other paintings from the same museum(s), so camera and varnish are held equal (from 16 paintings here).","Within his own canvases, dark brown turns up as the lightest note in 67% of the paintings that hold it, 5.8x the archive's rate (from 16 paintings here).","Pairs dark jungle green with dark olive brown more than chance would predict (3 of 16 paintings here).","Pairs bistre with café noir more than chance would predict (3 of 16 paintings here).","His single largest palette family (smoky black, dark olive brown, dark walnut) covers 88% of his paintings here.","Keeps 2 distinct palette families here, from smoky black, dark olive brown to dark olive brown, dark brown."]}